# The sidebar's edge (Rail.tsx SidebarEdge: the library's edge, @sf.handle_drag, edge_look, edge_tip):
# MBUI_FIXTURE=drive MBUI_WIN=1280x800. The pointer onto the edge (its bar, its line, its words by the pointer a moment
# later, following it down), the edge dragged 60 wider and let go, the pointer away; then pressed alone (the sidebar
# folded to the rail) and the pointer away.
timeout 20000
until 设计稿
wait 600
move 296 420
wait 1000
move 296 560
wait 600
drag 296 560 60 0 600
wait 900
move 700 600
wait 600
tapxy 356 560
wait 900
move 700 600
wait 600
exit
